# Foundation:
#   [x] Copy this file to .env
#   [ ] Install minimal dependencies: pip install rich typer
#   [ ] Test orchestrator: python src/orchestrator/main.py test
#
# Integration work:
#   [ ] Add only the keys needed for the active task
#   [ ] Keep live posting, bot deployment, and email automation disabled
#   [ ] Move production secrets into GitHub Secrets or deployment secrets
#
